      "contextFingerprint": "b1a4e3c3f060f30507e9af0290e522b996161de7b54e112a341e2a6274b47c02",
      "sourceText": "1. 空的 `std::function` 直接调用。调用前先判断 `if (callback)`。\n2. 签名不匹配。比如回调需要 `int(int, int)`，就不能传入只接收一个参数的可调用对象。\n3. 保存回调时引用捕获了已经销毁的局部变量。\n4. 只需要临时调用一次，也把参数写成 `std::function`，在性能敏感代码中会产生不必要开销。\n5. 以为成员函数可以直接赋给 `std::function<void(int)>`。非静态成员函数还需要对象，下一节会用 `std::bind` 和 Lambda 解决这个问题。",
      "translatedText": "1. Empty `std::function` Direct call\\. Before calling, first check `if (callback)`\\.\n2. Signature mismatch\\. For example, the callback requires `int(int, int)`，so you cannot pass a callable object that accepts only one parameter\\.\n3. When saving the callback, the reference captured a local variable that has already been destroyed\\.\n4. Even if it only needs to be called temporarily once, also write the parameter as `std::function`，which incurs unnecessary overhead in performance\\-sensitive code\\.\n5. Assuming that a member function can be directly assigned to `std::function<void(int)>`\\. A non\\-static member function also requires an object; the next section will use `std::bind` and Lambda to solve this problem\\.",
